## 5. Setup Feature Selection (`.agents/nextjs-setup-features.json`)

Read the recorded selection before assuming a tool exists: a disabled feature is
deliberate, not broken. `N1`–`N13` map to the runbooks under
`nextjs-dev-setup/references/features/`. Do not add configuration for a disabled
feature without enabling it in the selection first.

